      "description": "Develop a spray containing GEMs specifically designed to break down common clothing stains (oils, food) to achieve hygiene. This pre-treatment or spot treatment would drastically reduce the need for full water immersion washes, conserving water while ensuring cleanliness. This is a targeted application of bioremediation principles for efficient, low-water textile cleaning.",
